window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>Abbey goes shopping.</p> <p>Tarak learns an important fact about human female biology.</p> <p>Ami develops new (and somewhat scary) abilities.</p> <p>Oh, and it's Christmas soon.</p> <p>It's just another day in the life of our fearsome Kordolians and their human mates. A light-hearted peek into Tarak and Abbey's new life on Earth.</p> <p>Contains mature themes.</p>"; 
